{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>בחמר</b> — defective, and its letters are the numerical value of רמ״ח (248) limbs. Four types of affliction in the verse: \"And they embittered their lives with hard labor, with mortar (בחמר) and with bricks and with all labor in the field, all their labor which they worked upon them with rigor.\" Therefore each and every plague of the four plagues — and according to the one who teaches five plagues, he also counts \"And the Egyptians worked the Children of Israel with rigor\" —"], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:11:36.675347308Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}